bability. But the rule of the reason is not fully satisfied because it would prefer A (3000 > 2000), whereas the individual preferred B. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason as defined. The reasoning process diverges from the reason’s rule, even though some elements (focus on most probable outcome) are present.",
